flowchart LR
    S1[Scotty<br/>picks the highest priority sub-issue<br/>of the highest priority issue in the<br/>current Sprint backlog, marks it To Analyze]
    L1[Each lead in scope<br/>gives directions in a comment]
    S2[Scotty<br/>marks the sub-issue In Progress,<br/>dispatches it to Crew]
    C1[Crew<br/>works on the task, opens a PR]
    S3[Scotty<br/>adds the stub comments to the PR]
    S4[Scotty<br/>marks the sub-issue Leads review]
    L2[Each lead in scope<br/>reviews the PR,<br/>adds their decision to their comment]
    D{All leads approved?}
    S5[Scotty<br/>marks the task Done, merges the PR]
    S6[Scotty<br/>marks the task as Reviewed,<br/>dispatches it to Crew]
    C2[Crew<br/>addresses PR comments,<br/>updates its comment]

    S1 --> L1 --> S2 --> C1 --> S3 --> S4 --> L2 --> D
    D -->|yes| S5
    D -->|no| S6 --> C2 --> S4
